                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Annotated full-text of national-level general election manifestos at a natural-sentence level of 43 political parties from Germany, Ireland, and the UK from 1970-2025. This repository aims to provide clean and accurate (as much as possible) full-text versions of election manifestos to facilitate all scholarly research for which parties’ election manifestos are relevant. More details on the structure of the dataset is found in the accompanying release note."
